                        "entry_id": "2f48ee0e-f14d-31c0-98d5-ca8cde20aa96",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Any of various birds active during the nighttime or associated with night; a nocturnal bird."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0adf1275-366e-4473-9ae0-282ba9764288",
                                "sense_id": "f02d740d-2109-3f7a-8696-474755563981",
                                "text": "Upon the middle of the night,\nWaking she heard the nightfowl crow:\nThe cock sung out an hour ere light"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "607442ce-44fd-4cee-bc5c-7734978937cf",
                                "sense_id": "f02d740d-2109-3f7a-8696-474755563981",
                                "text": "Now this wilderness was so utterly waste that not even the barking of a dog or the sound of a nightfowl could be heard."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "25ce7267-8d69-4ca1-8d69-3fcce1b03e20",
                                "sense_id": "f02d740d-2109-3f7a-8696-474755563981",
                                "text": "He could see the ghostly outline of the distant peaks of the mountains, he could hear the haunting cries of nightfowl and coyote; but these things failed to interest him."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a6ad9895-fb73-4ee7-9eb9-a3bba016d42f",
                                "sense_id": "f02d740d-2109-3f7a-8696-474755563981",
                                "text": "An eagle? No, that could scarcely be; eagles were not nightfowl, nor would one descend this close to humans."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
